(text "Regulators and sequencing" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 14 0) (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "65d78e2c-182c-59be-bd5f-42fd7635cced"))
(text "Sequence: VIN>8V -> +5V (U5) -> PG_5V enables +5V_USB (U6). CM5 starts from +5V; CM5_3V3 then enables +3V3 (U8).\n+3V3_NVME (U7) is enabled by PCIE_PWR_EN from the CM5. Nothing drives a CM5 pin before +5V is valid (CM5 datasheet 3.1).\nLMR336x0: VFB=1.0V. 5V: 100k/24.9k. 3.3V: 100k/43.2k. fsw=400kHz, L=6.8uH, CIN 2x10uF+220nF (datasheet table 9-1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2c6a188e-e84b-5e34-be62-ecb012ee16ae"))
